  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育－彼拉提斯",
    "sub_ename": "PILATES",
    "describe_ch": "風靡紐約、席捲全球的時尚運動Pilates，從瑪丹娜到國際名模，歐美已經超過千萬人瘋狂愛上的運動，時尚瘦身運動--「彼拉提斯」。\r\n彼拉提斯（Pilates）結合東方瑜伽、太極拳和西方運動中擷取菁華，自成一套運動，藉由各種地板運動及輔助器械，配合呼吸及集中心念，達到強化核心肌群（core muscles，包括腹肌、背肌、骨盆底肌肉、髖關節肌肉、臀部）的目的。",
    "describe_eh": "Sweep New York, sweep across global fashion sport Pilates, from red Na of agate to international famous model, America and Europe has already exceeded ten million people's crazy sports that love, fashion weight-reducing sports --' he draws and carries then '. \r\nHe draws and carries it then ( Pilates) Combine eastern yoga, pick the essence of fetching in tai-chi and western movement, having a set of sports of one's own, moving with various kinds of floor and auxiliary apparatus, cooperate and breathe and concentrate the heart to read, it reach strengthen being key skin group (core muscles ,including abdominal muscle, carry skin, pelvis bottom the muscle, hip joint muscle, buttock of) Purpose.\r\n",
